      "name": "@local/firmware-finder",
      "title": {
        "en": "Firmware Finder",
        "zh": "固件检索"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Type /firmware to find production firmware by device model and OS in the Teambition release board archive fields, with alist product-directory fallback (e.g. CP Debian images that never reach Teambition), including sub-model variants (APOLLO2-MIX) and equivalent families (7≡7A, 12≡12A).",
        "zh": "输入 /firmware 触发：按机型和系统，在 Teambition 发版看板的归档字段中定位量产固件，返回线刷与 OTA 直链；Teambition 没有链接时用 alist 产品目录兜底（如只发到 alist 的 CP Debian 整机包）。含归档链接目录里的子型号变体（如 APOLLO2-MIX）与等价族（7≡7A、12≡12A）。"
      },
      "icon": "icon.svg",
      "author": "Alone-show",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/Alone-show/firmware-finder",
